        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-normal text-accent">Survivor benefit</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-normal text-ink sm:text-4xl">
          A pension choice with long-term consequences.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Electing a survivor benefit reduces your annuity but provides continuing income to your spouse.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[680px] text-left text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-canvas text-muted">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Choice</th>
